{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04372","headline":"故园置酒 · 刘希夷","name":"故园置酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒熟人须饮，春还鬓已秋。\n愿逢千日醉，得缓百年忧。\n旧里多青草，新知尽白头。\n风前灯易灭，川上月难留。\n卒卒周姬旦，栖栖鲁孔丘。\n平生能几日，不及且遨游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}